k best in small teams, close to the people who build.</p><p>Brand identity</p><p>Strategy, naming, logo and visual systems</p><p>Product design</p><p>Research, UX flows and polished UI</p><p>Design systems</p><p>Tokens, components and documentation</p></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1366 768\" width=\"1366\" height=\"768\"></svg><div class=\"ov\"></div></div><div class=\"m\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,1)\"><div class=\"mc\"><img class=\"mi\" style=\"width:74.1%;aspect-ratio:460/608;object-fit:cover;object-position:39.9% 50%;opacity:1\" src=\"https://cdn.example/api/assets/PBv6l4qnKh9xtgFA\" alt=\"Man Work\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:rgba(178,63,29,1);letter-spacing:0.3em\">About</span></p></div><h2 class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.15\"><span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Serif',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21.4px;color:rgba(20,20,20,1)\">I believe good design feels inevitable — like it could never have been any other way.</span></span></h2><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(85,82,76,1)\">Before going independent I led design at two early-stage startups and taught typography at ESAD. I work best in small teams, close to the people who build.</span></p></div><div class=\"rt\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:rgba(20,20,20,1)\">Brand identity</span></p></div><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(85,82,76,1)\">Strategy, naming, logo and visual systems</span></p></div></div><div class=\"rt\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:rgba(20,20,20,1)\">Product design</span></p></div><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(85,82,76,1)\">Research, UX flows and polished UI</span></p></div></div><div class=\"rt\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:rgba(20,20,20,1)\">Design systems</span></p></div><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(85,82,76,1)\">Tokens, components and documentation</span></p></div></div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"p4\" aria-label=\"Contact\" class=\"rf\" style=\"background:rgba(20,20,20,1)\"><div class=\"pg\"><div class=\"sr\"><p>Have a project in mind?</p><h2>Let’s make something good together.</h2><p>hello@miraokafor.example</p><p>Instagram<br>Dribbble<br>LinkedIn</p><p>© 2026 Mira Okafor · Lisbon, Portugal</p><p>Back to top ↑</p></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1366 768\" width=\"1366\" height=\"768\"></svg><div class=\"ov\"></div></div><div class=\"m\" style=\"background:rgba(20,20,20,1)\"><div class=\"mc\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:rgba(189,184,174,1)\">Have a project in mind?</span></p></div><h2 class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1\"><span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Serif',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:44px;color:rgba(242,239,233,1)\">Let’s make something good together.</span></span></h2><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Serif',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-size:23.5px;color:rgba(240,164,135,1)\">hello@miraokafor.example</span></p></div><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:end;line-height:1.9\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:rgba(242,239,233,1)\">Instagram</span></p><p style=\"text-align:end;line-height:1.9\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:rgba(242,239,233,1)\">Dribbble</span></p><p style=\"text-align:end;line-height:1.9\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:rgba(242,239,233,1)\">LinkedIn</span></p></div><div class=\"rt\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:start;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(189,184,174,1)\">© 2026 Mira Okafor · Lisbon, Portugal</span></p></div><div class=\"tx\" style=\"opacity:1\"><p style=\"text-align:end;line-height:1.3\"><span style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:rgba(189,184,174,1)\">Back to top ↑</span></p></div></div></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<a class=\"badge\" href=\"https://opencanvas.example/?ref=site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Made with Pinselo</a>\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('form.fm,form.mf').forEach(function(f){\n  if(f.classList.contains('fm')){var fs=f.querySelector('.fs');\n  f.addEventListener('input',function(){fs.style.fontSize=(f.clientWidth/parseFloat(f.dataset.w)*parseFloat(f.dataset.s))+'px'});\n  function size(){f.style.fontSize=(f.clientWidth/parseFloat(f.dataset.w)*parseFloat(f.dataset.s)*0.85)+'px'}size();addEventListener('resize',size)}\n  f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();var d={};\n    f.querySelectorAll('[name]').forEach(function(i){if(i.type==='checkbox'){if(i.checked)(d[i.name]=d[i.name]||[]).push(i.value)}else if(i.type==='radio'){if(i.checked)d[i.name]=i.value}else d[i.name]=i.value});\n    fetch(f.action,{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(d)}).then(function(r){return r.json().then(function(j){\n      f.querySelectorAll('.bad').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('bad')});\n      if(r.ok){if(window.__ocTrack)window.__ocTrack('form',f.getAttribute('aria-label')||'Form');var m=document.createElement('div');m.className='done';m.setAttribute('role','status');m.textContent=j.message||'Thanks!';f.appendChild(m)}\n      else Object.keys(j.problems||{}).forEach(function(k){var x=f.querySelector('[name=\"'+k+'\"]');if(x)x.classList.add('bad')})})})});\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","pages":[{"page":"iiJ3jnrzCfBhk0uD","head":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1366 768\" width=\"1366\" height=\"768\">","faces":[{"family":"Instrument Serif","weight":800,"italic":false},{"family":"Instrument Serif","weight":800,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":500,"italic":false},{"family":"Instrument Serif","weight":400,"italic":false},{"family":"Instrument Serif","weight":400,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":400,"italic":false},{"family":"Inter","weight":400,"italic":